Package: goedel
Type: Package
Title: Arithmetic Syntax, Metamathematics and Explicit Proof Checking
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Dimitrios", "Geromichalos", email = "riskdatascience@web.de",
           role = "cre", comment = "Dr."))
Description: Constructs and transforms first-order syntax, encodes syntax with
    exact natural-number codes, and checks explicit finite derivations in a
    documented calculus. Bounded search and literature-based metamathematical
    queries report their assumptions and evidential limits. Includes Q and PA
    presentations, finite and modal semantics, shared arithmetic formula graphs,
    exact register computations and concrete conditional fixed-point constructions.
    It does not decide
    general truth, consistency, or unprovability, and does not claim formal
    verification of literature results.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, digest, gmp, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, igraph
VignetteBuilder: knitr
